                        "sense_id": "312596d3-1f89-365e-bba8-851399c5f50b",
                        "entry_id": "f81f5032-3e81-3c9a-9e9d-8f29c1b055ff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The wave of a hand."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09db9486-c9f1-4aaf-8f24-c15f737ed9a6",
                                "sense_id": "312596d3-1f89-365e-bba8-851399c5f50b",
                                "text": "The leader, an upright, broad-shouldered old man, with snow-white hair, half halts his horse with a handwave of salutation, as he reaches the Imperial Crown Prince, then gallops on with the latter hanging close on his flank."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fe73324-f43d-4ba4-be40-c1a8c45c83ab",
                                "sense_id": "312596d3-1f89-365e-bba8-851399c5f50b",
                                "text": "\"[…]In fact I tell this mob\"— he gave a derogatory handwave in the direction of the ten or twelve pairs of eyes that were still intent on us—\"that I was the original of these Pappa-whatsits.\"\n\"Papparazzi.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "88a66939-70db-3c6f-a46d-6f9bbf0f1d3b",
                        "entry_id": "f81f5032-3e81-3c9a-9e9d-8f29c1b055ff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A glib statement or explanation that glosses over important details."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "178f6b5c-5886-4cab-95f4-54ef61c58bf4",
                                "sense_id": "88a66939-70db-3c6f-a46d-6f9bbf0f1d3b",
                                "text": "In this glib handwave by Friedman, the real results are determined independently of money and financing phenomena; given the way monetarists set up the analysis, the rate of growth of money can only affect the behavior of the price level."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
