                                "sense_id": "f37cfe04-13cd-3847-a313-7c9b905ba9c3",
                                "text": "Some readers may wish to handwave this restriction away, thinking of #92;tfrac#123;#92;partial#125;#123;#92;partial#92;rho#125; as a differentiable vector field on #92;mathbb#123;R#125;² that behaves badly at the origin; this approach will suffice for the purposes of this book."
